4
01:00:37,508 --> 01:00:39,385
<b>Doomed, from the very start...</b>

5
01:00:40,636 --> 01:00:43,681
<b>And I don't regret a SECOND of it.</b>

6
01:00:45,016 --> 01:00:46,017
<b>[Laughter]</b>
